753
02:14:20.282 --> 02:14:22.282
But do you know what she did today?

754
02:14:22.282 --> 02:14:24.282
She taught the Bible.

755
02:14:24.282 --> 02:14:26.282
It was not a personal opinion.

756
02:14:26.282 --> 02:14:28.282
You cannot say, I find Vanessa rather radical.

757
02:14:28.282 --> 02:14:30.282
This is the Bible. These are the words of the King.

758
02:14:30.282 --> 02:14:32.282
These are the words of Jesus.

759
02:14:32.282 --> 02:14:34.282
Hallelujah.

760
